  "body": "The residual GSG layout difference is localized to effective vector alignment: retained candidate/wheel reset stores match 4-byte versus16-byte layout, producing20bytes before pointer rounding and16bytes afterward. The candidate disables HAVE_EIGEN, which undefines the generated LINMATH_ALIGN macro. This grounds a proposed correction; the wheel's original Eigen version/full flags and an actual corrected build remain unknown.\n\nThis docs/evidence branch pins Debian Eigen3.4.0-4 DATA (530regular headers, no install/execution), explains CET and header-generated descriptor initializer rejection, and supplies a separate four-task Eigen/CET/section-scoped-descriptor implementation plan. The new128B descriptor/raw-parent equality contract and exact23-member carrier naming are specified. Build01 remains rejected and consumed; no new builder/workflow/request is implemented or activated.\n\nValidation:38 byte-backed forensic controls pass; source field-order/reset/load observations and530header hashes/version match. One independent read-only review found0Critical/0Important/1Minor; exact carrier paths were clarified in the contract. Existing production scripts/tests/native/workflows and282source identities are unchanged. Final canonical push+PR CI4jobs and outside-commit receipt verify the exact HEAD.\n\nPreserved7325basefiles/modes,299olderpins,10originals,main,Drafts102\u2013123,native8/image3/mapping/dispatch/realGLX/onefailedCgbuild01 and31sibling scratch trees/3846hashes. No new SDK compile/load/target/Panda/GL/Xvfb/model/officialORT/cohort/image operation, old request replay, main/sharedbase merge or Cloud/registry publication. Strict0/4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE remains.\n\nResult: docs/STAGE7_PANDA_SDK_CG_RESIDUAL_RESULT.md. Design: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-16-panda-sdk-cg-eigen-design.md. Plan: docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-16-panda-sdk-cg-eigen-candidate-v2.md. Final exactHEAD receipt: output/stage7-panda-sdk-cg-residual-01/final-verification.json. Future implementation must complete its own TDD/review/sourceCI/new compile-only request; this design grants no build or native slot.\n",
